  "detail_text": "Request for Quote - N6883626QS0037 0001 for Shear Maintenance in Gulfport, MS. This announcement constitutes the only solicitation; quotations are being requested. Requirement The Department of the Navy, NAVSUP FLC Jacksonville, requests quotes for Shear Maintenance (AS 500-14) in accordance with the attached Performance Work Statement (PWS). The Government anticipates award of a Firm-Fixed-Price, purchase order. Primary Location: Gulfport, Mississippi (specific delivery sites will be identified in individual orders) Submission of Quotes Due Date/Time: No later than the posted due date on this notice. Late quotes may not be considered. Submission Method: Email to yaynel.c.yambo.civ@us.navy.mil and robert.s.edwards42.civ@us.navy.mil with subject line: “N6883626QS0370001 – Vendor Name”. Required Quote Contents 1. Company Information: Legal name, UEI, CAGE, business size/status under NAICS 324121, point of contact, email, phone. 2. SIGNED SF-1449 AND SF-30. . 3. Technical: Follow Technical Volume requirements/instructions in 52.212-1 in the solicitation (page 25 of SF-1449). 4. Pricing: Complete, sign and submit the SF 1449 with a CLIN schedule that includes unit prices (page 3) and extended totals. 5. Certifications: Current SAM registration (or confirmation they are current in SAM). 6. Past Performance (optional but encouraged): Recent, relevant . Important: Follow all submission and volume/format instructions contained in the attached SF 1449 Solicitation.",
